      <comment>Super Heavy Walker
Armour 13-13-12: 20+60+30 = 110
Lumbering = 20
Structure Points: 100

Claw of Mork: 80
2x Rokkit Launchers: 30
2x Twin-Linked Big Shootas: 45
Kustom Mega Blasta: 20
Kustom Mega Cannon: 20+150%+100%=70

230 + 80 = 310
+ 30 = 340
+ 45 = 385
+ 20 = 405
+ 70 = 475</comment>
