          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A Gretchin Scavenger mob counts as being equipped with both assault grenades and defensive grenades.  However, any time either of these types of grenades are used (either as part of a shooting attack, during an Assault), the unit suffers D3 wounds, allocated randomly.  These wounds do not cause Morale checks.</characteristic>
