    <rule id="5881d5a1-85ef-7495-6994-4d6c19301e1e-d4a5a" name="Banner of da Great Waaagh!" page="56" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>As long as the bearer of the Waaagh! banner is still alive, all models in the same unit have the fearless special rule and add 1 to the Weapon Skill characteristic on their profile.  In addition, all friendly units with the Orks Faction within 12" re-roll failed Moral and Pinning checks.</description>
    </rule>
