    <rule id="5cd704ba-04d7-96c1-17fe-be4fb093117c-d4a5a" name="Cowardly Grots!" page="81" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>If a unit of Killa Kans suffers 25% or more casualties during any one phase, the unit must roll a D6 at the end of that phase. Add +1 to the dice roll if there are three or more Killa Kans in the unit, and a further +1 if there are one or more Deff Dreads within 6" of the unit. On a result of 3+ the test is passed and nothing happens. On a result of 1-2 the test is failed and every model in the unit immediately suffers a Crew Shaken result. Note that no models lose a Hull Point as a result of a failed Cowardly Grots! test</description>
    </rule>
