    <rule id="d7eb3420-dfcf-7347-ffe1-ebe8049ac555-d4a5a" name="Full Speed Ahead!" page="" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Grot Tanks move 2D6" per turn instead of moving like other vehicles, but may still fire all of their weapons without penalty.  If a squad of Grot Tanks opts to move Flat Out, it moves D6".  Grot Tanks ignore difficult terrain, but are affected by dangerous terrain.

Roll once for the entire squadron.  If a double 1 is rolled, on Grot Tank suffers a Penetrating hit.</description>
    </rule>
