    <rule id="fd7f4504-57fc-802c-dddb-e0c92d0ee751-d4a5a" name="Ghazghkull's Leftenuntz" page="56" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Both of the Ork Warbosses in the Formation have +1 WS on their profile.  Furthermore, at the start of each battle, before deployment, make 2 rolls on the Waaagh! Ghazghkull Warlord Traits table, re-rolling duplicates, and apply both of the results to Ghazghkull Thraka in addition to his standard Warlord Trait.</description>
    </rule>
