    <rule id="e50ede20-ee64-b903-4c7e-63b4928349e6-d4a5a" name="Green Tide" page="0" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>All of the units of Boyz and the Warboss form a single unit known as the Green Tide.  The Warboss cannot leave this unit.  The Green Tide counts as 11 units for Victory Points purposes if it is completely destroyed.  If the Green Tide ever rolls a Breaking Heads or Squabble result on the Mob Rule table, any resulting hits are allocated by the Formation's controlling player.</description>
    </rule>
