      <description>1 Siege Breaker
2 Burner of Worlds
3 Fortress Destroyer
4 Master of Timing
5 Lord of Precision
6 Strategic Attacker</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="7fd4900f-cbd2-08dc-6966-d4fcfd445a28-d4a5a" name="Warlord Trait: Planetstrike Defender" hidden="true">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>1 Protector of Worlds
2 Fortress Commander
3 Lord of the Ambush
4 Prescient Defender
5 Counterfire Master
6 Strategic Defender</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e1d946f4-7a63-9dd4-83ee-30f9113863ff-d4a5a" name="Warlord Trait 1: Prophet of the Waaagh!" page="92" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>The Warlord gains the Waaagh! specialrule (pg 54). If the Warlord already has the Waaagh! special rule then, in addition to the usual effects, all friendly models with the 'Ere We Go! special rule gain the Fearless special rule when he calls a Waaagh!, until the start of thier next turn.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e6902b47-4128-e455-191c-881c4bdd5e1a-d4a5a" name="Warlord Trait: Waaagh! Ghazghkull" page="0" hidden="true">
