    <profile id="94b1df7c-15b5-66c2-86e9-b98f59dd8294-d4a5a" name="Da Finkin' Kap" page="0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The wearer generates an additional Warlord Trait from the Strategic Traits table. If the additional trait is the same as the first trait they generated, roll again until a different trait is generated.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="77f90741-e2ae-b719-fd80-f601bbfd7e1a-d4a5a" name="Da Fixer Upperz" page="0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In each of your Shooting phases, instead of firing a weapon, a model equipped with da Fixer Upperz can choose to repair a single friendly vehicle he is in base contact with or embarked upon. To repair a vehicle, roll a D6. If the result is 3 or more, you may either restore a lost Hull Point or repair a Weapon Destroyed or an Immobilised result instead; this is effective immediately.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="f16890d5-514b-4c15-ae47-1e0630827270-d4a5a" name="Da Killa Klaw" page="0" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
