      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the beginning of the enemy Movement phase, nominate a single enemy vehicle that is within 2" of the vehicle's grabbin' klaw. On the roll of a 4+, that vehicle may not move this turn. Flyers and Skimmers cannot be attacked by a grabbin' klaw.</characteristic>
